<br/><br/>
Please "REPLY TO ALL" when responding to this message.
<br/><br/><br/>
Your options for payment are as follows:
<br/><br/>
1. Mail a check to Premier Property Management Group LLC, PO Box 381887, Germantown, TN 38183
<br/><br/>
2. Log onto your owner portal in Propertyware where you can submit a payment via your bank account. Log on by clicking here:
<br/>
<a href="https://app.propertyware.com/pw/portals/ppmg/owner.action" target="_blank">https://app.propertyware.com/pw/portals/ppmg/owner.action</a>
<br/><br/>
To make a payment online: Log in, click Dashboard, then click "New Contribution" and follow the steps accordingly. In the comments section please notate the property address and a brief description of what your payment is for. You can also select which payment account you want this payment to come from (checking, savings, credit card, etc). If you are not set up to receive owner draws via ACH/Direct Deposit, you must first set up a new bank account by following the steps below. <br><br>
You may now have multiple payment accounts associated with your portfolio (checking, savings, credit card). To set up multiple payment accounts, click on the arrow in the top right corner of the Dashboard, then click View Payment Information. Click New Account and fill in the required information, then click Save. 
